Z||000004||Raydar||03-18-2001||01:13 PM||||Is it firing on all six cylinders? <BR>Might be a coil pack gone south. If some cylinders are not firing, I'm thinking that the O2 sensor will see an over-rich condition, and reduce the gas to accommodate. The cylinders that ARE firing will run very lean, to the limits of the ECM programming. <P>------------------<BR>Raydar - aka Steve<P>88 T-top Formula<BR>88 soon-to-be-V6 coupe||||reg||1
